Key Takeaways

Completing the Red Team OPSEC room strengthened my understanding that successful red team operations rely not only on technical expertise but also on disciplined operational security. I learned how careful planning, secure communications, infrastructure protection, and risk management help ensure engagements remain controlled, realistic, and valuable to an organisation's security programme. These concepts are fundamental to conducting professional and ethical offensive security assessments.

